1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,320
I'll hold the rope.

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,320
Call me if anything happens.

3
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,380
I'll throw it down.

4
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,080
Oh no.

5
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,580
There's another formation here.

6
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:24,600
Chijiu.

7
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,320
Help me.

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:30,050
Senior brother is falling.

9
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:30,880
Chen Qinghe.

10
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,560
What he encountered wasn't an evil spirit.

11
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,360
It's something older.

12
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:48,880
Hold the rope.

13
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,080
It must not break.

14
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:57,610
This is an illusion.

15
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:08,690
A blood sacrifice of dark arts.

16
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:13,520
Once every twelve years.

17
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:15,480
Using these people's lives

18
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:17,520
to keep the ancestor alive

19
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,320
is their purpose.

20
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,479
It's your turn.

21
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:00,920
Wenshan.

22
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:03,050
Stop treating human lives like grass.

23
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,480
When Master was young,

24
00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:08,080
what did you know?

25
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:11,880
Hand over the secret of light arts and the Bagua compass.

26
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:15,210
Only by combining yin and yang can one achieve immortality.

27
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,540
You're obstinate.

28
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,600
Master.

29
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:25,140
Wealth, illness, separation, righteousness, officialdom, disaster.

30
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:35,140
These wrongfully killed people can finally rest in peace.

31
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,320
Master.

32
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,050
I got the third copper coin.

33
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:48,720
You were down there for over forty minutes.

34
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,320
There was no response at all.

35
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,120
There's a statue in the well.

36
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,440
Hundreds of resentful spirits

37
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:55,680
are sealed in a pair of living human eyes.

38
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:57,079
Whoever makes eye contact with it

39
00:03:57,079 --> 00:03:58,480
will be dragged in.

40
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,820
How long have those eyes been sealed?

41
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:02,290
Nearly a hundred years.

42
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,960
The Four Pillars Dragon Trapping Formation has been broken.

43
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:07,490
The yin energy in the pillars is dissipating.

44
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,080
Thanks for your hard work last night.

45
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:15,880
How did it go?

46
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,040
It's resolved.

47
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,240
As for the payment...

48
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,040
No need.

49
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,399
From now on, at night in the museum,

50
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:22,530
this kind of thing won't happen again.

51
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:28,920
Gather the Bagua.

52
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:31,120
The central palace will reveal itself.

53
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:33,050
Where Mo Wuhen's coffin is located

54
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:35,690
is the core of the Twelve Yuanchen Formation.

55
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,000
Mo Wuhen.

56
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,620
The legendary ancestor of the Mo family.

57
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:44,060
We already have the Kan, Dui, and Qian copper coins.

58
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:45,720
We still need Zhen, Xun, Gen, and Kun.

59
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:48,520
The Li hexagram fragment is in Mo Wenshan's hands.

60
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,480
The closest to Su City

61
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,880
is the Ma family in Guanzhong.

62
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:52,680
The Ma family.

63
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:54,960
The Tang family has ties with their ancestors.

64
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,880
I even visited their old house when I was a kid.

65
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:57,880
Coincidentally.

66
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:00,040
The Ma family has had a series of accidents in the past three months.

67
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,520
The head of the family is in his prime.

68
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:03,780
But he was injured and is in a wheelchair.

69
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:10,000
Miss Su.

70
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:11,600
The mutton soup you ordered has arrived.

71
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,120
Thank you.

72
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:12,520
Ah.

73
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,120
Let's eat first.

74
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,240
We'll go to Guanzhong tomorrow.

75
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:36,640
You must be Qinghe.

76
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:40,420
Your master, Daoist Xuanchen, is an old friend of mine.

77
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,220
Nice to meet you, Uncle Ma.

78
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,610
Hello, Uncle Ma.

79
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:45,080
Xiaotang is here too.

80
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,800
Since you are all here,

81
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,280
I won't beat around the bush.

82
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,159
Don't be so formal.

83
00:05:49,159 --> 00:05:50,400
Let's sit down first.

84
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:55,080
Uncle Ma.

85
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:57,000
How did you get hurt so badly?

86
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,280
Three months ago,

87
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,320
I was taking a carriage home.

88
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:03,620
It suddenly lost control and rushed down the slope.

89
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:06,480
I've walked this road for twenty years.

90
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,480
I know it with my eyes closed.

91
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,000
It's not just him.

92
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:14,080
Ever since our Ma family started cooperating with the Mo family,

93
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:17,040
his second uncle encountered a scaffolding collapse at the construction site.

94
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:20,480
Our little granddaughter suddenly fell and got hurt during her martial arts class.

95
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:24,480
Our family members have been getting into accidents one after another.

96
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,880
The grave keeper also said

97
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,800
that he always hears horse hooves at night,

98
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,800
but sees nothing when he goes out.

99
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:37,040
The Mo family set up a mountain-crushing curse here.

100
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,560
It first crushes the family's main pillar,

101
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,159
then cuts off the bloodline.

102
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,480
The ancestral tomb is the eye of the curse,

103
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,540
and the ancestral house is the mouth.

104
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:49,360
One every three feet,

105
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:50,960
circling the house,

106
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:52,560
exactly forty-nine of them.

107
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:55,800
The Ma family and the Mo family have no grudges.

108
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:57,880
Why would they harm my Ma family?

109
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,570
It's not about grudges.

110
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,880
The Ma family has good ley lines

111
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:03,120
and a thriving population.

112
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,980
What they want is this life force.

113
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:08,890
Uncle Ma.

114
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,240
We will go to the ancestral tomb tonight to break the curse.

115
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,520
Thank you, martial nephew.

116
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:15,360
I'll send a few Ma family disciples to help you.

117
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,300
The suppressing stake is right here.

118
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,520
The Mo family indeed left a backup plan.

119
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,320
Run faster.

120
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:33,580
Being possessed by the evil energy will bring you bad luck.

121
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:37,370
Come in quickly.

122
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,120
Don't worry.

123
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:48,240
Senior Brother will be fine.

124
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,120
Be careful, Senior Brother.

125
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,440
Feiniao.
